  {
   "identifier": "p-text",
   "id": "doc-1k129tgp34",
   "content": {
    "text": "<em>(sda)</em> Masai Russell ran a world record in the 100m hurdles in Zurich. The American lowered her personal best by five hundredths of a second to 12.09 seconds."
   },
   "prevElement": "image",
   "nextElement": "barrier"
  },
  {
   "id": "doc-49a5c0cb",
   "identifier": "barrier",
   "prevElement": "p-text",
   "nextElement": "p-text"
  },
  {
   "identifier": "p-text",
   "id": "doc-1k12bkorm0",
   "content": {
    "text": "Russell, who had already broken the North American record the previous year, clearly dominated the competition. Second-placed Nigerian Tobi Amusan crossed the finish line in 12.23 seconds, recording a season best. Dutchwoman Nadine Visser completed the podium, also running a season best in 12.34 seconds."
   },
